{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MyDiscord: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This is a magical tower defense game where you choose a faction from the Human Alliance, Orcs, Demons, and Undead, assemble your heroes and legions, and march to the battlefield to conquer the continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this prologue version, you will have access to 6 basic units and corresponding talent trees for both the Human Alliance and the Undead, along with 3-4 basic buildings for each faction, 3-4 magical skills, and the ability to attack other players' strongholds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each race can retain 2 strongholds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2743960?t=1770297204","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2743960?t=1770297204","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743960/f7612e9ed0b993207e2ed5a300081e7669b47020/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770297204","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743960/f7612e9ed0b993207e2ed5a300081e7669b47020/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770297204","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MyDiscord: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This is a magical tower defense game where you choose a faction from the Human Alliance, Orcs, Demons, and Undead, assemble your heroes and legions, and march to the battlefield to conquer the continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this prologue version, you will have access to 6 basic units and corresponding talent trees for both the Human Alliance and the Undead, along with 3-4 basic buildings for